LICH-002 Seed Corpus: Monad Encoder/Decoder

Seeds are built into the harness via f.Add() calls.
Additional seed files can be placed here for extended fuzzing.

Varint boundary values (encoded):
  0x00           -> 0
  0x3F           -> 63 (max 1-byte)
  0x40 0x40      -> 64 (min 2-byte)
  0x7F 0xFF      -> 16383 (max 2-byte)
  0x80 0x00 0x40 0x00 -> 16384 (min 4-byte)
